  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.1: New Economy.V2 namespace with EconomyClient: every call returns ApiResult/ApiError instead of LastErrorMessage, System.Text.Json, automatic token refresh, WithCompany, CancellationToken support, EconomySession for sharing one login between clients (server side). V1 (Economy.Api) is unchanged apart from a fix: ServerLogin failed with Duende.IdentityModel 8 (client assertion now sent in the body). FileApi temp path fixed on macOS/Linux.\n1.2.0: Updated dependencies (security fixes, IdentityModel replaced by Duende.IdentityModel). Interactive login (PKCE/Code) now listens on both IPv4 and IPv6 loopback, fixing login on macOS while keeping http://localhost:{port}/ as redirect uri. Added net8.0 target.",
